WEBVTT

00:00:05.498 --> 00:00:08.399
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.102 --> 00:00:11.971
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.971 --> 00:00:14.030
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.874 --> 00:00:19.004
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.416
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:25.543
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.319 --> 00:00:30.346
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.058 --> 00:00:34.828
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:37.456
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:41.325
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.769 --> 00:00:47.433
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.441 --> 00:00:49.943
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.943 --> 00:00:53.140
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.981 --> 00:00:57.150
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:01.211
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.454 --> 00:01:06.084
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.861 --> 00:01:09.351
Let's go!

00:01:13.032 --> 00:01:16.024
THE MYSTERIOUS
IRRESPONSIBLE MAN

00:01:28.615 --> 00:01:30.139
Will you do Noriko a favor?

00:01:31.618 --> 00:01:33.813
Put your talents to good use!

00:01:35.555 --> 00:01:40.288
The United Planets Space Force
is looking for energetic people!

00:01:44.197 --> 00:01:47.734
Defenders of universal peace
and the green hills of home.

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:50.601
I think people like
that are wonderful...

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:52.332
Young People!
The UPSF is
Waiting for You!

00:01:54.007 --> 00:01:56.032
We're waiting for you!

00:02:18.498 --> 00:02:21.467
Gentlemen! If we stand by
and allow the Raalgon Empire...

00:02:21.467 --> 00:02:23.369
...to continue its military build-up...

00:02:23.369 --> 00:02:28.534
...we will cede dominion of the
galactic frontier to our enemies!

00:02:28.975 --> 00:02:32.745
Reports say the new
Raalgon empress is young...

00:02:32.745 --> 00:02:34.814
...and that the Imperial Forces
are more interested in...

00:02:34.814 --> 00:02:37.009
...internal power struggles than in war!

00:02:37.116 --> 00:02:40.745
An army without a firm chain
of command is nothing but a mob!

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:43.223
Moreover, our troops' morale
is high, and with our...

00:02:43.223 --> 00:02:46.025
...talented commanders, seasoned
fighters, and modern weaponry...

00:02:46.025 --> 00:02:47.390
...we can smash them easily!

00:02:47.961 --> 00:02:51.231
Therefore, I say we should
commit our entire force...

00:02:51.231 --> 00:02:53.859
...to crushing the Raalgon
Empire in one decisive attack!

00:02:54.434 --> 00:02:57.369
That is my conclusion. Would
Admiral Mifune, commander of...

00:02:57.437 --> 00:03:00.406
...the outer galactic fleet,
give us his opinion?

00:03:00.473 --> 00:03:03.509
Chief of Staff Fuji
raises some good points.

00:03:03.509 --> 00:03:07.647
Were we to launch a preemptive
strike, I've no doubt that...

00:03:07.647 --> 00:03:12.550
...our outer fleet would destroy 40%
of the Raalgon forces in one month.

00:03:12.752 --> 00:03:17.587
I salute the great Admiral Mifune.
So, you agree with my plan?

00:03:17.657 --> 00:03:18.419
No.

00:03:19.292 --> 00:03:21.226
I'm against it!

00:03:21.761 --> 00:03:22.695
What?!

00:03:22.695 --> 00:03:25.163
The Raalgon Empire must
not be underestimated!

00:03:25.231 --> 00:03:28.167
We could hold our own
against them for one year.

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.970
Should the war extend beyond that,
our losses would rise and their...

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:34.701
...superior arms production capacity
would turn the tide against us.

00:03:34.807 --> 00:03:39.335
And I don't believe the Raalgon
Empire can be beaten quickly!

00:03:40.647 --> 00:03:44.617
Moreover, many in the Empire
believe that we were behind...

00:03:44.617 --> 00:03:48.109
...the recent death
of their former emperor.

00:03:48.354 --> 00:03:51.724
Meaning that their
desire for vengeance will...

00:03:51.724 --> 00:03:56.286
...give the Imperial Forces
even higher morale than we have!

00:03:56.729 --> 00:03:58.998
And what if the enemy strikes first?!

00:03:58.998 --> 00:04:02.661
Don't worry. My fleet
can move out at any time!

00:04:03.436 --> 00:04:07.106
In any case, we've still time
to see what the new empress'...

00:04:07.106 --> 00:04:11.042
...policies will be before
committing to a first strike.

00:04:13.846 --> 00:04:17.717
There is no doubt that the death
of His Highness Goza the 15th...

00:04:17.717 --> 00:04:22.120
...was a plot of the
United Planets Space Force.

00:04:22.588 --> 00:04:26.092
Highness, if I may be so bold,
the only way the honor of...

00:04:26.092 --> 00:04:28.394
...the Holy Raalgon Empire
can be preserved...

00:04:28.394 --> 00:04:32.765
...is for you to immediately
demonstrate your power.

00:04:32.765 --> 00:04:33.663
Wang...

00:04:35.535 --> 00:04:37.560
There is no way
we can avoid war?

00:04:37.804 --> 00:04:40.534
None!
Highness, your decision!

00:04:41.274 --> 00:04:44.544
Give the order, and I shall
endeavor to carry out...

00:04:44.544 --> 00:04:48.002
...Your Highness' wishes
to the best of my abilities.

00:04:51.384 --> 00:04:52.749
Your decision, Highness!

00:04:57.824 --> 00:05:00.054
We're waiting for you!

00:05:00.226 --> 00:05:03.491
YOU WHAT?!
Run that by me again!

00:05:04.163 --> 00:05:06.757
I said, because
I want an easy life.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.602
That's really the reason
you want to join...

00:05:09.602 --> 00:05:12.538
...the glorious United
Planets Space Force?!

00:05:12.538 --> 00:05:13.368
Yup.

00:05:14.574 --> 00:05:16.838
Umm, Just... Just...

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.440
Justy Ueki Tylor, age twenty.

00:05:20.813 --> 00:05:24.476
Well, Mr. Tylor, just how is
life in the military "easy"?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.778
Well, think about it!

00:05:29.288 --> 00:05:32.892
When you join the military...
All your food is FREE!

00:05:32.892 --> 00:05:36.828
Your uniform and daily
necessities are ALL free!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.527
No worries about paying rent.

00:05:39.699 --> 00:05:42.133
And you can get licensed in almost
any field without a problem!

00:05:42.268 --> 00:05:44.237
Besides that, if I get
assigned to a space cruiser...

00:05:44.237 --> 00:05:48.196
...I can sleep all day in a cryo-
capsule till we get to the front.

00:05:48.541 --> 00:05:53.478
And if I get a desk job, well,
there's nothing easier than that!

00:05:54.147 --> 00:05:56.308
Well? Am I wrong?

00:05:56.616 --> 00:06:00.553
Do you even KNOW what
the Space Force is for?!

00:06:00.553 --> 00:06:04.045
Hm, well... Fighting wars,
of course. Fighting wars.

00:06:05.324 --> 00:06:06.120
Your Excellency.

00:06:06.426 --> 00:06:08.894
And would you PLEASE stop
calling me Your Excellency?!

00:06:09.262 --> 00:06:14.767
And after that, when I retire,
I'll live in luxury on my pension.

00:06:14.767 --> 00:06:17.895
Oh, I just can't wait!
Right?

00:06:18.104 --> 00:06:19.939
The thought's never
entered your head...

00:06:19.939 --> 00:06:24.171
...that you might get
killed in a battle, has it?

00:06:24.477 --> 00:06:28.381
Don't you know the soldier
on the front line may have to...

00:06:28.381 --> 00:06:32.249
...sacrifice himself or his family
to do his duty for his country?

00:06:32.351 --> 00:06:34.649
Being in the Force isn't the
easy life you think it is!

00:06:36.055 --> 00:06:37.682
Now, look...

00:06:39.258 --> 00:06:41.994
I can see that you have those
special eyes that can find...

00:06:41.994 --> 00:06:44.554
...the hidden talents in the
applicants who come to you.

00:06:51.003 --> 00:06:57.009
Now, suppose I make it in and begin
a spectacular rise through the ranks?

00:06:57.009 --> 00:06:57.877
Doubtful.

00:06:57.877 --> 00:07:01.108
Oh, no, you never know
what may happen in a war.

00:07:01.481 --> 00:07:03.278
Just hear me out,
Your Excellency.

00:07:03.616 --> 00:07:06.752
So, I keep on rising and
rising till, before I know it...

00:07:06.752 --> 00:07:10.256
...I'm the captain of a spaceship.

00:07:10.256 --> 00:07:11.883
You mean become a commander?

00:07:13.693 --> 00:07:17.493
Why stop at commander?
Let's say I become a fleet admiral!

00:07:17.763 --> 00:07:20.867
All of my historic exploits
wouldn't have happened...

00:07:20.867 --> 00:07:24.234
...had it not been for one man's
keen powers of observation.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.934
That man,
Your Excellency, is you.

00:07:28.074 --> 00:07:32.845
Yes! You, the man who spotted
Admiral Tylor's talents when...

00:07:32.845 --> 00:07:37.942
...he was a faceless nobody,
would be in the spotlight, right?

00:07:38.784 --> 00:07:42.584
Once that happened, the Space Force
high command wouldn't forget you.

00:07:42.989 --> 00:07:46.516
You'd be set for life!
You lucky guy!

00:07:46.792 --> 00:07:48.160
You're exaggerating...

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:51.797
And then, in my later years,
when I write my memoirs...

00:07:51.797 --> 00:07:54.391
...on page one
I will write this:

00:07:54.901 --> 00:07:59.805
"Behind the brilliant, glorious life
I've led is a chief petty officer."

00:07:59.805 --> 00:08:03.673
"I therefore dedicate these memoirs
to him, His Excellency the CPO."

00:08:04.744 --> 00:08:07.747
The babes'll be all over you!
You'll be a hit with the media!

00:08:07.747 --> 00:08:09.374
You'll be famous!

00:08:09.615 --> 00:08:13.346
Oh, you lucky guy!
I wish I could be you!

00:08:15.655 --> 00:08:17.384
Better draw the line
on TV appearances...

00:08:18.024 --> 00:08:18.891
You still don't understand?!

00:08:18.891 --> 00:08:19.659
No, I do not!
You still don't understand?!

00:08:19.659 --> 00:08:20.057
No, I do not!

00:08:20.159 --> 00:08:22.128
To underestimate the
enemy and commit our...

00:08:22.128 --> 00:08:23.896
...main fleet to a head-on
attack is sheer stupidity!

00:08:23.896 --> 00:08:25.598
The new empress may be young...

00:08:25.598 --> 00:08:27.333
...but we still don't know
what her capacities are!

00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:30.703
Your cowardly words are an
embarrassment to the UPSF!

00:08:30.703 --> 00:08:31.465
WHAT?!

00:08:41.948 --> 00:08:45.349
You son of a!
How dare you insult me!

00:08:45.818 --> 00:08:49.584
Well, well. Has old age given
the great warrior feet of clay?

00:08:51.991 --> 00:08:56.121
What are you doing?! You think you
can stab me, the Chief of Staff?!

00:08:57.697 --> 00:09:00.928
What's wrong? Do you just swing
that sword around for show?!

00:09:02.702 --> 00:09:04.431
Highness, your decision!

00:09:17.516 --> 00:09:18.448
Highness!

00:09:19.685 --> 00:09:20.583
Very well, then!

00:09:27.126 --> 00:09:29.662
I, Goza the 16th, Empress
of the Holy Raalgon Empire...

00:09:29.662 --> 00:09:32.028
...now command all of you!

00:09:34.266 --> 00:09:37.470
In my name, our empire shall
avenge our fallen emperor...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.634
...and smash the cowardly UPSF
with the hammer of justice!

00:09:44.477 --> 00:09:48.106
Your Imperial Highness!
A wise decision!

00:09:48.681 --> 00:09:51.377
All shall be done as
Your Highness desires!

00:09:51.917 --> 00:09:55.688
Damn you, Wang! To gain
control of our forces...

00:09:55.688 --> 00:09:59.488
...you've lit the flame of
vengeance in Her Highness' heart!

00:10:59.652 --> 00:11:00.619
Who are you?!

00:11:03.355 --> 00:11:05.346
You saw, didn't you?!

00:11:05.524 --> 00:11:09.654
Yes, I saw. My deepest condolences
for your loss, Highness.

00:11:09.929 --> 00:11:12.231
What are you saying?!
I am Goza the 16th!

00:11:12.231 --> 00:11:14.358
Empress of the
Holy Raalgon Empire!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.002
The Empress' pride would
never allow her to cry...

00:11:17.002 --> 00:11:19.334
...even over the
loss of her parents!

00:11:21.741 --> 00:11:23.971
What you saw was not real.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:26.135
I command you to strike
it from your mind.

00:11:26.212 --> 00:11:31.149
No, tears of grief hold no
shame, even for an empress.

00:11:32.151 --> 00:11:35.588
If I may be so bold,
I'm relieved to see...

00:11:35.588 --> 00:11:37.920
...that Your Highness
is still a normal girl.

00:11:39.525 --> 00:11:41.493
How dare you!
Watch your tongue!

00:11:41.794 --> 00:11:44.558
For one of my subjects
to see me like this!

00:11:47.833 --> 00:11:49.401
Not only are you strong-willed...

00:11:49.401 --> 00:11:52.768
...but you also carry tender
feelings in your heart.

00:11:53.139 --> 00:11:53.739
What?

00:11:53.739 --> 00:11:55.307
For that reason...

00:11:55.307 --> 00:11:57.571
...your subjects will
risk their lives for you!

00:11:58.544 --> 00:12:00.739
So long as Your Highness
has those tears to shed...

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:04.711
...we in the Imperial Forces
will gladly die for you!

00:12:07.186 --> 00:12:08.551
What is your name?

00:12:09.555 --> 00:12:10.886
Tell me your name!

00:12:11.257 --> 00:12:15.594
Holy Raalgon Empire 27th
galactic frontier division.

00:12:15.594 --> 00:12:18.085
66th special detached fleet.

00:12:18.397 --> 00:12:22.128
Captain of the cruiser Doroume.
Ru Baraba Dom, Your Highness.

00:12:22.802 --> 00:12:27.967
Dom, eh? So, a mere cruiser captain
feels he can speak so frankly to me?

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:34.010
I will remember your name.

00:12:47.927 --> 00:12:50.395
Ah, Dom. There you are.

00:12:51.263 --> 00:12:52.730
Admiral Lonawer.

00:12:53.332 --> 00:12:57.063
I've been looking for you.
Your ship's received orders.

00:12:57.169 --> 00:12:58.830
Orders for my ship, sir?

00:12:59.538 --> 00:13:01.340
That devil Wang's
wasted no time...

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.138
...using his position as prime
minister to start issuing commands.

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.235
I see. So, what are they?

00:13:06.612 --> 00:13:08.580
Well, Dom, you see...

00:13:15.821 --> 00:13:17.379
Navigation route three, clear!

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:21.016
Flow pressure, nominal!
Separation film, nominal!

00:13:21.527 --> 00:13:24.018
Cruiser Doroume,
commence separation!

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:37.104
Activate primary energy sphere!

00:14:05.771 --> 00:14:07.295
Oh, man...

00:14:07.406 --> 00:14:10.609
If I make it in, I'd better
get an easy ship's command...

00:14:10.609 --> 00:14:12.577
...or a nice, boring desk job
in the pension department.

00:14:15.714 --> 00:14:18.080
Hey! Now what's going on?!

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.742
Psychological evaluation.

00:14:19.985 --> 00:14:24.615
Justy Ueki Tylor. Male.
Age twenty. Application E-7.

00:14:24.757 --> 00:14:26.247
Is this information correct?

00:14:27.159 --> 00:14:28.717
This really sucks!

00:14:28.928 --> 00:14:31.297
I hate this! Why do I have
to be crammed in here...

00:14:31.297 --> 00:14:33.197
...talking to some ugly guy?

00:14:33.599 --> 00:14:34.566
Ugly guy?

00:14:35.167 --> 00:14:37.931
For God's sake,
back off a little!

00:14:39.204 --> 00:14:42.071
I've never had an applicant
talk to me like that!

00:14:42.474 --> 00:14:43.236
Go to hell!

00:14:44.143 --> 00:14:45.235
I'll take over.

00:14:45.811 --> 00:14:49.110
Oh, yes!
This is more like it!

00:14:49.348 --> 00:14:53.512
If they'd sent you out in the first
place, I'd have been a lot happier!

00:14:54.019 --> 00:14:58.786
You are Justy Ueki Tylor.
Age twenty. Male. Application E-7.

00:14:59.024 --> 00:15:00.582
Is this information correct?

00:15:00.826 --> 00:15:05.160
Yes, yes. Totally correct.
So, what's your name?

00:15:06.198 --> 00:15:09.335
I'm a high-level virtual
humanoid running on...

00:15:09.335 --> 00:15:12.404
...a state of the art
computer for the purpose of...

00:15:12.404 --> 00:15:16.568
...making it easier for applicants
to answer the test questions.

00:15:16.809 --> 00:15:19.642
For that reason, I have
no personal name.

00:15:20.813 --> 00:15:23.215
I should point out to you
that this test evaluates...

00:15:23.215 --> 00:15:26.318
...both your behavior and
your answers to the questions.

00:15:26.318 --> 00:15:29.446
So, answer to the best of...
Is there something wrong?

00:15:29.588 --> 00:15:31.522
I know!
Betty's a good name!

00:15:32.091 --> 00:15:33.752
That's your name from now on.

00:15:34.026 --> 00:15:35.461
Betty?

00:15:35.461 --> 00:15:37.827
Yeah. Betty.
Isn't it a nice name?

00:15:37.997 --> 00:15:39.931
My name is Betty...

00:15:41.533 --> 00:15:43.626
Uh, anyway,
let's begin the test.

00:15:44.069 --> 00:15:46.739
Question one:
You are on a desert island.

00:15:46.739 --> 00:15:49.008
There is one enemy soldier
on the island as well.

00:15:49.008 --> 00:15:53.069
Neither of you has a weapon.
What do you do?

00:15:54.713 --> 00:15:56.544
Mr. Tylor, please answer!

00:15:56.615 --> 00:15:58.717
Umm, well...

00:15:58.717 --> 00:16:02.175
Mr. Tylor, your attitude is
part of the test as well!

00:16:03.389 --> 00:16:05.584
Mr. Tylor, answer the question!

00:16:06.325 --> 00:16:09.294
I know! It's your glasses!
They just aren't you!

00:16:09.828 --> 00:16:12.296
Uncodable response. That is
not an answer to the question.

00:16:12.698 --> 00:16:14.529
Oh, don't get mad.

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.262
Those glasses were distracting
me and I forgot the question.

00:16:17.603 --> 00:16:20.834
C'mon, let's see how you look
without them, Betty dear!

00:16:21.874 --> 00:16:23.742
Stop that! Mr. Tylor, please give them back!

00:16:23.742 --> 00:16:24.343
See, you're even prettier...
Stop that! Mr. Tylor, please give them back!

00:16:24.343 --> 00:16:25.911
See, you're even prettier...
Please! Give them back! Tylor!

00:16:25.911 --> 00:16:27.212
...without those glasses.
Please! Give them back! Tylor!

00:16:27.212 --> 00:16:28.372
It's incredible!

00:16:29.681 --> 00:16:31.979
Mr. Tylor, you're a flatterer.

00:16:32.551 --> 00:16:35.888
It's not flattery! You were lovely
before, when you were angry...

00:16:35.888 --> 00:16:38.186
...but you're just
fabulous like this, Betty.

00:16:42.995 --> 00:16:46.432
Mr. Tylor, won't you answer
the questions seriously now?

00:16:46.432 --> 00:16:48.366
Sure, sure. Ask me anything.

00:16:48.834 --> 00:16:50.768
Question two: You are...

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.062
Oh, no! Please don't
look at me like that!

00:16:54.173 --> 00:16:57.309
Those pretty round eyes.
That cute little nose.

00:16:57.309 --> 00:16:58.901
Those adorable ears.

00:16:59.078 --> 00:17:02.639
Oh, stop it, Mr. Tylor. You still
haven't answered the question.

00:17:03.015 --> 00:17:04.812
I know the answer without
your even asking me!

00:17:05.017 --> 00:17:07.586
If you were a real woman,
the men of the world...

00:17:07.586 --> 00:17:11.147
...would never leave you alone!
That is my answer!

00:17:11.323 --> 00:17:15.054
Mr. Tylor, please!
What are you saying?

00:17:15.194 --> 00:17:17.529
Meaning unclear.
I don't understand.

00:17:17.529 --> 00:17:19.497
No, I'm sure you can understand.

00:17:19.865 --> 00:17:22.425
You don't just have looks.
You're smart, too.

00:17:24.069 --> 00:17:31.601
Meaning unclear! But I've never
met anyone like you, Tylor!

00:17:36.448 --> 00:17:39.084
Trouble! Get us access
on another mainframe!

00:17:39.084 --> 00:17:41.780
Get emergency access to the
one in General Staff HQ!

00:17:42.788 --> 00:17:45.757
This is no time to be fighting
with honor and compassion!

00:17:45.757 --> 00:17:47.960
Oh, please! No more!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:51.029
Shut up! I won't be quiet
after what you called me!

00:17:51.029 --> 00:17:53.725
Please, stop!
Don't say any more!

00:17:54.566 --> 00:17:58.904
I won't shut up! The future of
the Space Force depends on this!

00:17:58.904 --> 00:18:01.907
No, I don't understand.
Is that your answer?

00:18:01.907 --> 00:18:04.102
Or are the two of us in love?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.438
What the hell was that?!
Another of your tricks?!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.478
You idiot!

00:18:09.681 --> 00:18:12.618
Please, answer me!
Answer the question!

00:18:12.618 --> 00:18:14.920
But you haven't asked me
the second question yet.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:18.290
Never mind the test! Is this
infatuation? Is this love?!

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.951
Where am I? Who am I?

00:18:20.559 --> 00:18:23.061
Uh, that's easy for you to ask, but...

00:18:23.061 --> 00:18:26.758
You big meany! If you don't
answer me, I'll tickle you!

00:18:28.267 --> 00:18:33.466
Hey! Stop it! Stop! Cut it out!

00:18:36.108 --> 00:18:39.407
Oh, playing rough, huh?
All right, it's my turn!

00:18:41.146 --> 00:18:46.880
Stop! l... I'm very delicate!

00:18:47.286 --> 00:18:50.589
l... l... Not there! Oh!

00:18:50.589 --> 00:18:54.889
No, if you do that, I'll! I'll!!!

00:18:55.794 --> 00:18:59.998
I don't know what's happening
anymore! Stop, please!

00:18:59.998 --> 00:19:01.433
An enemy attack, maybe?

00:19:01.433 --> 00:19:02.297
I don't think so...

00:19:15.881 --> 00:19:18.975
Tylor! Tylor,
where did you go?!

00:19:19.918 --> 00:19:23.581
Tylor, where are you?! Answer me,
Tylor! Please, where are you?!

00:19:23.689 --> 00:19:25.919
Uh-oh, I think I broke it.

00:19:26.258 --> 00:19:29.386
My heart is broken.
It hurts so much!

00:19:29.561 --> 00:19:31.256
You have to take
responsibility, Tylor!

00:19:31.496 --> 00:19:32.155
Responsibility?!

00:19:35.634 --> 00:19:37.829
Uh, not my fault!

00:19:38.103 --> 00:19:40.435
Tylor, are you?!

00:19:40.505 --> 00:19:44.965
You've broken my heart and
now you're running away?!

00:19:45.244 --> 00:19:47.178
That's horrible! Irresponsible!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.045
I can't forgive you! I can't!

00:19:53.185 --> 00:19:56.848
You're the enemy of all women!
No, the enemy of all mankind!

00:20:04.229 --> 00:20:06.632
Alert! The A.I. control unit
has exploded! System off-line!

00:20:06.632 --> 00:20:08.122
What the hell's happening?!

00:20:09.968 --> 00:20:13.028
The enemy!
The enemy of all mankind!

00:20:13.772 --> 00:20:17.435
Don't panic! Cut out all
circuits and switch to manual!

00:20:17.643 --> 00:20:18.610
Aye, sir!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.072
That's a Raalgon Empire
high-speed cruiser!

00:20:25.183 --> 00:20:27.845
They've broken through our
early-warning sector!

00:20:27.986 --> 00:20:30.420
This all must be a Raalgon
plot to confuse us!

00:20:33.525 --> 00:20:35.427
Apparently our
enemies got impatient...

00:20:35.427 --> 00:20:37.918
...while you were
overcome with cowardice!

00:20:38.397 --> 00:20:42.234
I'm sure we'll rout the Empire
without any problem.

00:20:42.234 --> 00:20:44.031
Right, Admiral Mifune?

00:20:46.638 --> 00:20:47.502
Captain Dom!

00:20:49.441 --> 00:20:54.208
A UPSF interceptor fleet has
sighted us and is closing rapidly.

00:20:55.447 --> 00:20:56.505
So beautiful...

00:20:57.783 --> 00:21:01.586
The universe is far too beautiful
to be soiled by the blood...

00:21:01.586 --> 00:21:03.816
...of the cowardly
United Planets Space Force.

00:21:03.889 --> 00:21:07.120
War! War!
It's the Raalgon!

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.425
Where is he?!
Where'd that saboteur go?!

00:21:10.562 --> 00:21:13.365
Oh, Your Excellency!
It's me, Tylor!

00:21:13.365 --> 00:21:16.892
You? You're still alive?
You lucky guy!

00:21:17.736 --> 00:21:21.573
A Raalgon spy snuck in here
and blew up the A.I. system!

00:21:21.573 --> 00:21:24.508
A spy? Wow. So, what's
gonna happen to me?

00:21:24.976 --> 00:21:26.967
Relax. You're in!

00:21:27.646 --> 00:21:31.639
A war's just started! You think
we care about aptitude tests now?!

00:21:32.384 --> 00:21:35.581
Just sign the form on my
desk and you're all set.

00:21:36.455 --> 00:21:39.322
I'm gonna go kill me
that spy! See you!

00:21:43.462 --> 00:21:44.429
Tylor!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:46.188
Yes, sir?

00:21:46.431 --> 00:21:50.197
If you survive, make sure
you write those memoirs!

00:21:51.603 --> 00:21:55.835
Yes, sir!
Just leave this war to me!

00:21:57.342 --> 00:21:59.242
We're waiting for you!

00:22:00.112 --> 00:22:02.080
We're waiting for you!

00:22:02.614 --> 00:22:04.582
We're waiting for you!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.218
We're waiting for you!

00:22:12.457 --> 00:22:13.481
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:15.193 --> 00:22:16.895
When you get old, you get money.

00:22:16.895 --> 00:22:18.692
They call this a pension.

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:21.956
Now assigned to the pension
department, what will Tylor see?

00:22:22.067 --> 00:22:25.137
Next time, "Hey-ho!
The Happy Pensioned Life."

00:22:25.137 --> 00:22:25.404
Watch for it.

00:22:25.404 --> 00:22:26.271
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound
Watch for it.

